From: RetroPixels
Subject: [PATCH] RetroPixels: flight stick feel for a gamepad thumbstick (RP_FLIGHTSTICK)

A round dead zone, the round gate stretched to a square one, a cubic
response curve and time-based smoothing for full-range stick axes, turned
on by RetroPixels through the RP_FLIGHTSTICK environment variable.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as Supermodel.
